 entire half-open period. Hourly searches omit equipment without an `hourlyPrice`. Omit `kind` to
 include both boards and sails; otherwise it must be `board` or `sail`.
 
-Cancellation is intentionally not part of this first API. The school policy is retained for the
-future cancellation feature: cancellations at least 24 hours before the booking start receive the
-full amount; later cancellations receive no refund.
+Use `cancel(bookingId, at)` to cancel a booking at a UTC ISO-8601 hour. It returns
+`{ bookingId, refund }`, where cancellations made at least 24 hours before the booking start refund
+the full amount and later cancellations refund zero. A booking can only be cancelled once. Cancelled
+bookings no longer reserve their equipment.
